<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Demande de matériel refusée</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:32px 16px;background:#F4F4F0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#000;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td align="center">
    <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#fff;">
      <tr><td style="padding:40px;background:#2C2C2C;color:#fff;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#D8EC95;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Espace Association</p><h1 style="margin:0;font-size:30px;">Demande refusée</h1></td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:40px;"><p>Bonjour {{ prenom }},</p><p>La mairie de Feytiat n'a pas pu accepter votre demande de réservation de matériel pour l'association <strong>{{ association.nom }}</strong>.</p>
        {% if noteInterne is not empty %}
          <div style="margin:24px 0;padding:16px 20px;background:#F4F4F0;border-left:3px solid #61646B;"><strong>Motif communiqué par la mairie</strong><p style="margin:8px 0 0;white-space:pre-line;">{{ noteInterne }}</p></div>
        {% endif %}
        {% include 'emails/_equipment_reservation_details.html.twig' %}
        <p>Pour toute question, contactez les services de la mairie.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:24px 40px;background:#000;color:#fff;font-size:12px;">Mairie de Feytiat — Plateforme Associations</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>